{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-legacy","title":"Enduring Legacy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-birth-of-science","title":"科学的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/the-birth-of-science","wordCount":1575,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"aristotle-today","title":"今日的亚里士多德","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/enduring-legacy/aristotle-today","wordCount":1525,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现亚里士多德的永恒遗产。他与近代科学的诞生有着复杂的关系——他注重经验的科学精神为科学奠基，而近代科学又恰恰是在批判、超越他的某些学说中兴起的。在今日，亚里士多德依然鲜活——他的德性伦理学强势复兴，他的逻辑、政治思想仍在启迪当代。本章揭示亚里士多德智慧跨越时空、历久弥新的生命力。\n"}